    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "For a class M of groups let L(M ) be the class of groups G such that the\nnormal subgroup aG generated by an element a belongs to M for any a ∈ G. Is it\ntrue that the class L(M ) is finitely axiomatizable if M is the quasivariety generated\nby a finite group?                                                         A. I. Budkin",
